WEBVTT

00:00:17.490 --> 00:00:19.950
Nocturne Girl's School Lacrosse Club

00:00:28.850 --> 00:00:29.670
It's on.

00:00:31.810 --> 00:00:32.230
huh?

00:00:35.550 --> 00:00:40.560
 Asakura Nobunaga

00:00:35.550 --> 00:00:40.560
 awake?

00:00:35.550 --> 00:00:40.560
"Nocturne Girl's School Lacrosse Club" is on

00:00:39.480 --> 00:00:40.930
I know.

00:00:40.930 --> 00:00:45.470
