00:01:00.000 --> 00:01:01.730
(It's the love for lacrosse!)

00:01:02.670 --> 00:01:04.000
Haruna-sama...

00:01:04.260 --> 00:01:07.150
(I think we will make a great team.)

00:01:08.920 --> 00:01:11.670
(Welcome to Nocturne Girl's School's lacrosse club!)

00:02:43.890 --> 00:02:47.850
"I want to come with you..."

00:02:51.440 --> 00:02:56.390
Aw... Nogizaka-san. More beautiful than ever today!

00:02:58.720 --> 00:03:01.200
