00:03:06.170 --> 00:03:07.240
I see.

00:03:07.810 --> 00:03:09.270
Gosh! Him again!

00:03:10.240 --> 00:03:12.130
That Ayase Yuuto!

00:03:14.590 --> 00:03:17.940
Haha...I've gotten used to it now.

00:03:18.090 --> 00:03:22.920
And then, the shot that Haruna-sama made was, like all animes...

00:03:22.340 --> 00:03:27.730
Oh hey! Haruka! That hobby is a secret, remember?

00:03:28.270 --> 00:03:30.850
Oh. Y-yes.

00:03:31.500 --> 00:03:35.770
A secret between just me and Yuuto-san.

00:03:36.290 --> 00:03:40.740
Oh, man, w-we're going to be late at this pace. Let's go.

00:03:40.940 --> 00:03:41.630
Okay.

00:03:44.890 --> 00:03:46.450
Mornin'

00:03:46.750 --> 00:03:49.630
Oh! Yuuto! Nogizaka-san! Great timing!

00:03:49.630 --> 00:03:50.320
Huh?

00:03:50.450 --> 00:03:51.390
Shina?

00:03:54.270 --> 00:03:55.840
It's a hot spring?

00:03:56.180 --> 00:04:01.950
Yup. I got free tickets from my dad. Thought might as well go with everyone.

00:04:02.020 --> 00:04:04.350
I see. Looks like a pretty nice place.

00:04:04.580 --> 00:04:06.660
Nogizaka-san, do you want to come?

00:04:06.840 --> 00:04:08.830
Oh...C-Can I?

00:04:09.100 --> 00:04:11.730
Yeah. Yoshiko and Mai are coming too.

00:04:13.420 --> 00:04:15.210
I want you to come!

00:04:15.310 --> 00:04:17.490
Th-thank you.

00:04:18.060 --> 00:04:21.420
Sounds good, all girls-it'll be fun.

00:04:21.640 --> 00:04:24.840
In that case, I'm happy to join you guys!

00:04:25.040 --> 00:04:26.980
Great! Done deal!

00:04:26.980 --> 00:04:29.010
Yes, thank you so much.

00:04:29.410 --> 00:04:31.600
Hot springs...I'm a bit jealous.

00:04:31.750 --> 00:04:33.390
Oh? Does Yuuto want to come too?

00:04:33.530 --> 00:04:34.080
Huh?

00:04:34.400 --> 00:04:38.350
Yup. I have 4 more right here, so it would be okay if we ask 3 more guys.

00:04:40.930 --> 00:04:44.710
Thank you, Amamiya-san. I fully understand your thoughtfulness!

00:04:44.710 --> 00:04:47.680
A dreamland where all men's romances and desires are let loose!

00:04:48.690 --> 00:04:51.190
You guys weren't even invited yet! Geez.

00:04:51.590 --> 00:04:58.220
Hey now, it's okay. It's more fun with more people. It could be interesting. Yeah?

00:04:58.740 --> 00:05:01.020
The Goddess is here!

00:05:03.610 --> 00:05:05.520
Special News!

00:05:03.610 --> 00:05:05.520
Open Event

00:05:06.460 --> 00:05:07.160
Haru...

00:05:11.630 --> 00:05:13.270
Huh, okay, I guess...

00:05:14.000 --> 00:05:17.250
("Nocturne Girl's School Lacrosse Club" Special News! Open event ~Tea Party with Haruna-sama~)

00:05:24.050 --> 00:05:27.760
What! It's just us in this coach.

00:05:29.040 --> 00:05:31.070
It seems intentional.

00:05:31.300 --> 00:05:32.890
It's a miracle!

00:05:32.890 --> 00:05:34.820
Thank you, Goddess-Amamiya!!

00:05:34.900 --> 00:05:36.820
Nah, don't think it matters...

00:05:37.030 --> 00:05:39.540
Hey, Shina-chan. Is this it?

00:05:39.540 --> 00:05:43.710
Yeah, that's it! It's not right without a salted squid!

00:05:43.810 --> 00:05:47.240
Oh, this girl... Is squid all you think about?

00:05:47.560 --> 00:05:49.280
Can't help that I like them!

00:05:52.260 --> 00:05:55.730
Haruka, a beginning of a trip is from a mandarin.

00:05:55.730 --> 00:05:59.680
Is it really? Looks good! Ah! Cold!

00:05:59.680 --> 00:06:03.030
Haha...this is what they call a frozen mandarin.

00:06:08.770 --> 00:06:14.030
That waterfall, during this season, has plentiful volume of water...it's almost like...

00:06:14.210 --> 00:06:16.790
Yuuto-san? Are you okay?

00:06:17.060 --> 00:06:20.390
Yeah. Haruka looks so happy.

00:06:21.530 --> 00:06:26.800
Yes. It's my first time going on a trip with everyone like this.

00:06:27.870 --> 00:06:30.900
I was all alone in my junior-high years.

00:06:32.590 --> 00:06:38.170
Oh yeah...Your secret was revealed and you were isolated, right.

00:06:41.530 --> 00:06:50.420
But...I really like being here with everyone...but...If I could come just with Yuuto sometime...

00:06:54.240 --> 00:06:59.680
Oh, w-what am I saying...so embarrassing.

00:07:02.390 --> 00:07:03.180
Ha-Haruka.

00:07:03.300 --> 00:07:04.070
What?

00:07:04.470 --> 00:07:06.660
Um, when we get there...

00:07:14.550 --> 00:07:16.040
Do you want some lunch?

00:07:16.040 --> 00:07:17.430
Ahh! Wha-what...

00:07:17.730 --> 00:07:19.940
Hazuki-san!

00:07:21.730 --> 00:07:23.790
What are you so surprised about?

00:07:24.290 --> 00:07:28.010
Wh-why are you here? And why are you dressed like that?

00:07:29.850 --> 00:07:31.560
Hello, onii-san.

00:07:31.890 --> 00:07:33.870
Such a coincidence.

00:07:33.850 --> 00:07:35.070
Mi-Mika!

00:07:35.170 --> 00:07:36.950
Na-Nanami-san too!

00:07:37.050 --> 00:07:39.040
It can't be just a coincidence!

00:07:39.140 --> 00:07:44.060
It's true. I mean, we are the Nogizaka-Family maid-team, after all.

00:07:44.330 --> 00:07:47.180
Alright, but I don't want to deal with any trouble!

00:07:47.380 --> 00:07:50.360
Huh? What, what? Nogizaka-san's little sister?

00:07:50.360 --> 00:07:51.560
Wasn't it...

00:07:53.050 --> 00:07:56.700
I'm Nogizaka Mika. Thank you for being so kind to my sister.

00:07:56.720 --> 00:07:58.890
Oh my gosh! So cute!

00:07:59.140 --> 00:08:04.030
I'm Sawamura Ryouko, nice to meet you! Oh, you're so cuddly.

00:08:01.280 --> 00:08:02.410
He-hey, sis!

00:08:03.650 --> 00:08:08.690
Hm, Mika-sama is pretty vulnerable to attacks.

00:08:09.040 --> 00:08:09.970
I see.

00:08:18.900 --> 00:08:19.800
Wh-who is that?

00:08:20.110 --> 00:08:25.470
Rank No. 8 of Nogizaka-Family maid-team, Alicetia Rain, also known as Alice-chan.

00:08:31.750 --> 00:08:36.740
You can't underestimate Alice-chan. She's surprisingly...

00:08:39.510 --> 00:08:44.520
So many young and pretty girls here. Okay, let's drink together.

00:08:45.210 --> 00:08:49.010
Uh, um. Alcohol is allowed only for those over 20 years old.

00:08:49.520 --> 00:08:52.720
Hey, don't be so square. It's fine.

00:09:06.390 --> 00:09:07.980
That's enough, Alice-chan.

00:09:09.870 --> 00:09:14.010
Alice-chan's role is VIP guard and sabotage.

00:09:14.500 --> 00:09:16.020
Remember that from now on.

00:09:16.590 --> 00:09:17.190
Yeah...

00:09:33.660 --> 00:09:36.430
So, what are you guys doing here!?

00:09:36.450 --> 00:09:40.630
What took you guys so long? Obviously you guys need a guardian.

00:09:40.500 --> 00:09:45.470
Aw yes, I'll be looking out to stop anything like juvenile sex.

00:09:45.470 --> 00:09:48.210
That's not convincing at all.

00:09:48.210 --> 00:09:50.640
Sorry about these weirdoes.

00:09:50.640 --> 00:09:55.730
No worries. But everyone gathers around Yuuto, huh?

00:09:57.330 --> 00:10:00.020
Drink, drink. It's a welcoming-drink!

00:10:00.320 --> 00:10:01.830
Oh, so cute!

00:10:01.650 --> 00:10:03.230
H-hey, Sensei!

00:10:11.300 --> 00:10:13.880
I guess this is okay for what it is...?

00:10:16.490 --> 00:10:19.560
Aw, it feels so good.

00:10:19.560 --> 00:10:24.880
Scenery is beautiful, the hot spring feels great. What more can we ask for?

00:10:27.830 --> 00:10:31.770
Hm, this view is fantastic too.

00:10:32.430 --> 00:10:35.200
Nogizaki-san is great even in nude.

00:10:37.020 --> 00:10:44.690
Pure-white skin! Big boobs! Small waist! The ideal combination...so admirable.

00:10:44.740 --> 00:10:46.140
Wh-wh-what. No.

00:10:48.710 --> 00:10:52.610
Oh I see, now Haruka-sama is the target.

00:10:52.930 --> 00:10:55.330
Sawamura Ryouko...what a fearful girl.

00:10:57.200 --> 00:10:59.770
But Mika-chan is so cute too!

00:10:59.600 --> 00:11:03.600
W-w-wah! D-don't touch me there!

00:11:04.200 --> 00:11:07.140
Hmph, it sparks the imagination.

00:11:07.140 --> 00:11:08.990
Lots of different ideas.

00:11:08.990 --> 00:11:10.760
Thank you, God.

00:11:24.440 --> 00:11:25.060
Haru...

00:11:33.850 --> 00:11:35.250
Wh-what, what?

00:11:37.120 --> 00:11:42.790
Sawamura-onee-san messed up my pace a little, but the real deal begins now, onii-san!

00:11:43.320 --> 00:11:43.680
What?

00:11:45.600 --> 00:11:47.010
(The eighth "Somehow let onii-san and onee-chan spend one on one lovely time @ hot spring city" meeting!)

00:11:48.070 --> 00:11:54.650
The eighth "Somehow let onii-san and onee-chan spend one on one lovely time @ hot spring city" meeting!

00:11:54.930 --> 00:11:59.730
Hot springs are special! You have to be more aggressive and lovey-dovey.

00:11:59.990 --> 00:12:02.550
We can't only do so much, but will give it our best to help you out.

00:12:08.300 --> 00:12:12.240
Alright! Let's drink at our room now!

00:12:11.920 --> 00:12:15.290
Aw! Massage in our room!

00:12:14.960 --> 00:12:16.960
Tadalala

00:12:17.210 --> 00:12:18.540
Momi momi~

00:12:22.010 --> 00:12:24.710
Yuuto...you...

00:12:24.960 --> 00:12:30.770
Yuu-kun is... Yuu-kun is trying to make the maid-chan suck on something hard and big...

00:12:26.890 --> 00:12:29.720
(Wasabi)

00:12:31.150 --> 00:12:32.470
so exciting.

00:12:32.650 --> 00:12:35.010
N-no! It's not...! This is...!

00:12:33.190 --> 00:12:34.270
(script)

00:12:34.830 --> 00:12:38.730
No excuses! Sit there and listen! You perverted nerd!

00:12:38.630 --> 00:12:43.520
Wait wait wait! You're mistaken! Ah! I'm gonna get stabbed!

00:12:43.460 --> 00:12:45.910
Ahh!

00:12:47.380 --> 00:12:48.360
Yuuto-san?

00:12:53.760 --> 00:12:54.550
Wasabi...

00:12:58.310 --> 00:13:01.300
Man, finally all cleared up.

00:13:01.300 --> 00:13:06.200
As always, Mika-group's ideas seem a little off...

00:13:07.510 --> 00:13:11.420
I couldn't tell her again about the "event"...

00:13:13.160 --> 00:13:15.140
I gotta tell her soon...

00:13:19.250 --> 00:13:19.720
Hm?

00:13:20.270 --> 00:13:20.650
Huh?

00:13:26.100 --> 00:13:27.230
Yu-Yuuto!

00:13:27.320 --> 00:13:28.330
Shi-Shiina!

00:13:28.430 --> 00:13:30.670
Wh-why? Isn't this the men's side?

00:13:30.730 --> 00:13:35.500
Huh? N-no. At night, the men's and women's sides switch.

00:13:35.640 --> 00:13:38.160
What? That means this is...

00:13:38.430 --> 00:13:41.510
Wow. It's my first time being at open-air bath.

00:13:41.510 --> 00:13:44.460
Oh no! The other guests...

00:13:44.460 --> 00:13:45.940
Hide behind the rocks!

00:13:46.000 --> 00:13:47.180
Oh, oh yeah.

00:13:52.260 --> 00:13:59.710
Just stay here till the other guests leave. Don't look this way, no matter what.

00:14:01.910 --> 00:14:04.280
Yeah. I know.

00:14:05.260 --> 00:14:07.760
Geez, you better thank me.

00:14:08.000 --> 00:14:10.170
S-sorry. I owe you a bunch.

00:14:10.440 --> 00:14:14.580
I'm just kidding. Yuuto, you really are gullible.

00:14:14.580 --> 00:14:16.310
Wh-what the...

00:14:19.010 --> 00:14:21.180
Do you want to go soon?

00:14:24.050 --> 00:14:25.230
Can I go now.

00:14:25.370 --> 00:14:29.920
Wait a little longer...when everyone leaves the changing room, make a run for it.

00:14:30.430 --> 00:14:31.140
Got it.

00:14:33.740 --> 00:14:35.990
What? Why are you laughing so much?

00:14:35.990 --> 00:14:38.080
I just remembered some things.

00:14:40.950 --> 00:14:44.340
Do you remember when we first met?

00:14:44.340 --> 00:14:54.190
Oh. Yeah. How can I forget that manga-like meeting. Even after that...

00:14:54.400 --> 00:15:03.640
Swimming contest, school festival, and now again...we always get into this kind of situation.

00:15:04.080 --> 00:15:07.090
Yeah. It's really unreal for it all to be just accidents.

00:15:10.380 --> 00:15:13.200
Do you really think it's all accidental?

00:15:16.560 --> 00:15:17.770
Um

00:15:19.300 --> 00:15:22.790
Yuuto, are you...?

00:15:22.790 --> 00:15:25.090
Yay! It's all ours!

00:15:27.510 --> 00:15:29.990
This bath is really nice too.

00:15:30.560 --> 00:15:33.770
Hm? Shiina, when did you get here?

00:15:33.990 --> 00:15:38.860
Haha, yeah. It's really nice in here.

00:15:39.000 --> 00:15:41.660
Even Haruka's here? What am I going to do?

00:15:42.580 --> 00:15:45.150
This feels so good...

00:15:50.380 --> 00:15:55.550
Oh hey, what's going on between Nogizaka-san and Ayase-chi?

00:15:55.550 --> 00:15:56.200
Hm?

00:15:56.630 --> 00:15:58.700
Truthfully, are you guys dating?

00:15:58.760 --> 00:15:59.620
What?

00:16:01.110 --> 00:16:09.120
I mean, you guys seem to get along so well at school, and I see you guys staring at each other. I feel love in the air.

00:16:09.190 --> 00:16:11.160
Uh, oh no.

00:16:11.490 --> 00:16:14.490
Hm? What do you think about Ayase-tchi?

00:16:14.550 --> 00:16:17.610
Um... I... I...

00:16:26.520 --> 00:16:28.060
Ha-Haruka...

00:16:35.230 --> 00:16:38.490
I-I...think Yuuto-san is...

00:16:42.670 --> 00:16:45.810
I'm sorry, I can't quite see with the steam.

00:16:46.030 --> 00:16:47.660
A-are you okay?

00:16:49.210 --> 00:16:50.630
Yuuto! Go now!

00:16:50.650 --> 00:16:51.580
Oh, yeah.

00:16:52.370 --> 00:16:55.750
Oh you. You should know that you're glasses will get foggy from the steam.

00:16:55.750 --> 00:16:58.580
Aww, are you okay?

00:17:05.860 --> 00:17:09.720
How does Haruka feel about me?

00:17:12.550 --> 00:17:13.690
Let's go that way.

00:17:16.050 --> 00:17:17.260
This, and that too.

00:17:19.340 --> 00:17:20.440
Look at this.

00:17:23.150 --> 00:17:26.530
I couldn't tell her till the day of the event, after all.

00:17:26.530 --> 00:17:31.770
Onii-san, it's your chance. Just like we told you, sneak out and spend some alone-time!

00:17:31.770 --> 00:17:34.560
I recommend the treasure museum for a date.

00:17:34.560 --> 00:17:35.710
Very exciting.

00:17:35.780 --> 00:17:36.800
Nod nod.

00:17:36.870 --> 00:17:37.900
You guys...

00:17:39.380 --> 00:17:40.210
Good luck!

00:17:44.140 --> 00:17:45.000
Onee-chan!

00:17:44.990 --> 00:17:46.140
Oh, Mika.

00:17:46.140 --> 00:17:49.050
What kind of relationship do Haruka and I have?

00:17:50.080 --> 00:17:57.630
I just came across the top secret of the so-called "Nuit-Étoile", perfect and undefeated girl, Nogizaka Haruka, and...

00:17:57.630 --> 00:18:02.650
we kind of became friends...and different things happened,

00:18:02.670 --> 00:18:11.920
but we've never told each other how we feel, so it's not like we're dating, I think. But...

00:18:14.470 --> 00:18:17.660
How does Haruka feel about me?

00:18:17.700 --> 00:18:19.660
I'll get some souvenirs for Nanami-san too.

00:18:19.850 --> 00:18:24.990
Really? Then I have to get something for Mika-sama too.

00:18:27.180 --> 00:18:31.900
Uh um. Is something worrying you, Yuuto-san?

00:18:32.040 --> 00:18:36.860
Oh, oh no. It's nothing like that. Sorry, I worried you.

00:18:37.270 --> 00:18:46.040
Uh, um. Please feel better. We're lucky to be here. I want to make good memories with Yuuto-san.

00:18:46.610 --> 00:18:47.430
Haruka...

00:18:47.890 --> 00:18:52.110
("Nocturne Girl's School Lacrosse Club" Special News! Open event ~Tea Party with Haruna-sama~)

00:18:49.370 --> 00:18:52.110
Yeah. What was I thinking.

00:18:52.950 --> 00:18:53.610
Haruka.

00:18:54.980 --> 00:18:55.460
Huh?

00:18:56.210 --> 00:18:57.270
Yuuto-san?

00:18:58.010 --> 00:18:58.630
Let's go!

00:18:58.660 --> 00:19:00.130
What? Yu- Yuuto-san!?

00:19:03.210 --> 00:19:07.150
Wow. Onii-san's pretty bold.

00:19:07.380 --> 00:19:08.430
It's a runaway date...

00:19:09.500 --> 00:19:10.310
Runaway?

00:19:11.000 --> 00:19:11.770
Yuuto?

00:19:12.400 --> 00:19:13.140
Alice-chan!

00:19:19.890 --> 00:19:23.710
Oh my, what is this geyser doing here?

00:19:23.810 --> 00:19:27.460
Too bad. We've lost them.

00:19:27.740 --> 00:19:29.630
Alice-chan, good job.

00:19:30.280 --> 00:19:30.630
"Bui"

00:19:30.280 --> 00:19:31.270
(v for victory)

00:19:31.940 --> 00:19:32.590
Yuuto...

00:19:36.960 --> 00:19:39.010
Wh-what happened, Yuuto-san?

00:19:38.980 --> 00:19:43.160
S-sorry. I just really wanted to spend some time alone with you... and this...

00:19:44.670 --> 00:19:48.020
Th-this is an event for "Nocturne Girl's School Lacrosse Club"!

00:19:48.610 --> 00:19:53.870
It's being held around here. So, um...do you want to go with me?

00:19:54.540 --> 00:19:59.240
Yuuto-san... Okay! I want to go with Yuuto-san too!

00:20:04.910 --> 00:20:05.770
So this is it.

00:20:05.970 --> 00:20:08.660
Wow! It's a life-sized Haruka-sama!

00:20:11.680 --> 00:20:14.670
Wait...do we need tickets to enter?

00:20:15.580 --> 00:20:17.780
Hey! Is that you, Yuuto?

00:20:18.640 --> 00:20:19.350
That sounds like...

00:20:19.860 --> 00:20:21.490
It is Yuuto!

00:20:22.120 --> 00:20:24.200
No-Nobunaga! Why are you here!?

00:20:24.340 --> 00:20:32.690
Dumb question. Anyways, look at you, Yuuto, coming all the way here for this. You're completely hooked on this, huh? I'm so happy!

00:20:33.210 --> 00:20:35.130
I don't get why you'd be happy...

00:20:36.400 --> 00:20:39.940
Nobunaga! Do you have any extra tickets on you for this?

00:20:40.190 --> 00:20:48.610
What? Did you just run in to this event? What's wrong with you? You have to come here in the morning to get the tickets.

00:20:44.930 --> 00:20:49.640
(To all guests of "Nocturne Girl's School Lacrosse Club" Tea Party with Haruna-sama, thank you for coming. Today's event start at 2 p.m. Please purchase tickets in advance, which will be on sale at 10 a.m.-Animers)

00:20:50.220 --> 00:20:55.350
Well, it's a pretty common mistake for beginners. Just be careful from now on. Here.

00:20:56.390 --> 00:20:58.670
You can go in easily with this.

00:20:59.060 --> 00:21:01.300
But, what about you?

00:21:01.530 --> 00:21:06.830
I'll be fine! They know me. Alright, enjoy the event, you two!

00:21:10.870 --> 00:21:17.150
He really is a hidden King of Akihabara...wait, "you two"?

00:21:17.150 --> 00:21:19.150
That was awesome.

00:21:20.060 --> 00:21:22.790
I hope Nogizka-san and Ayase-kun are okay.

00:21:22.820 --> 00:21:26.070
Can't believe there was a geyser there.

00:21:28.050 --> 00:21:31.850
I wonder if Yuuto and Nogizaka-san are official.

00:21:32.480 --> 00:21:34.840
But if they aren't yet...

00:21:34.670 --> 00:21:37.830
Shiina! We're gonna leave you!

00:21:40.530 --> 00:21:41.810
I'll keep trying.

00:21:51.650 --> 00:21:54.000
Hello everybody!

00:21:54.060 --> 00:21:55.920
Hello!

00:21:56.660 --> 00:22:01.270
I'd like to welcome you guys today to the tea party of Nocturne Girl's School Lacrosse Club's Haruna-sama!

00:22:01.330 --> 00:22:03.300
Yay!

00:22:03.300 --> 00:22:05.920
It kind of sounds like Haruka's voice.

00:22:05.640 --> 00:22:10.710
Thank you so much! I'm truly happy that you guys came to support me.

00:22:13.660 --> 00:22:18.880
Now I have one more wonderful memory. Thank you so much.

00:22:28.000 --> 00:22:32.150
It doesn't matter how Haruka feels about me.

00:22:32.880 --> 00:22:35.730
I just want to see her smile.

00:22:40.510 --> 00:22:43.940
Yuuto-san, please be with me from now on too.

00:24:15.260 --> 00:24:20.480
Nogizaka Vocabulary Fundamentals

00:24:16.910 --> 00:24:20.440
Mika-chan and Nanami's Nogizaka Vocabulary Fundamentals!

00:24:20.480 --> 00:24:31.070
Komiké

00:24:20.620 --> 00:24:22.440
Nanami-san, what is komiké?

00:24:22.440 --> 00:24:27.060
It's short for comic-market, the world's largest literary coterie magazine sales exhibit.

00:24:27.060 --> 00:24:28.800
Do they carry our books too?

00:24:28.850 --> 00:24:31.430
They might have it at the East Building from the third day.

00:24:31.070 --> 00:24:35.820
Next: "Please put it in...

00:24:31.430 --> 00:24:34.990
Wow. I wonder what it's like. I'm gonna go check it out soon!

00:24:35.820 --> 00:24:40.900
See you next time.
